#: ../../quick-reference.rst:203
msgid ""
"JA4: a whole fingerprint, or a prefix and ``*``; no fingerprint, no "
"match. Patterns: ``*`` or ``.*`` any; ``^...$`` exact; trailing ``*`` "
"prefix; leading ``/`` exact path; else case-insensitive substring. Paths "
"are matched in normal form. Order: WAF -> trie deny/allow -> rules -> "
"score -> bypass -> trie challenge -> bots -> default."
msgstr ""
"JA4：完整的指纹，或者前缀加 ``*``；没有指纹则不匹配。模式：``*`` 或 ``.*`` 匹配任意内容；``^...$`` 精确匹配；末尾 "
"``*`` 为前缀；以 ``/`` 开头为精确路径；其他为不区分大小写的子串。路径按规范形式匹配。顺序：WAF -> 字典树 deny/allow "
"-> 规则 -> 分数 -> 绕过 -> 字典树 challenge -> 机器人 -> 默认。"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:205
msgid "Storage (Edge) in SQL"
msgstr "SQL 中的存储（Edge）"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:220
msgid ""
"SQLite (``sqlite3 <dir>/sibuna.db``); actions are lowercase. Score "
":math:`\\le -50` -> deny prefix; :math:`\\ge 50` -> allow. Cluster: same "
"secret on every node, one PostgreSQL database, ``--features postgres``, "
"``--database-url-file <file> --cluster-node N`` with a unique N from 1 to "
"8,388,607; no member list, leader or cluster TLS (SID 0011)."
msgstr ""
"SQLite（``sqlite3 <dir>/sibuna.db``）；动作名为小写。分数 :math:`\\le -50` -> deny "
"前缀；:math:`\\ge 50` -> allow。集群：每个节点使用相同的密钥，一个 PostgreSQL 数据库，``--features "
"postgres``，``--database-url-file <file> --cluster-node N``，其中 N 唯一，取值 1 到 "
"8,388,607；没有成员列表、领导者或集群 TLS（SID 0011）。"

